ds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater Island</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Oak Depot</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$12,500</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Allows you to create blueprints</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.58.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 15th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Blueprint Fabricator</b> can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> for $12,500.\n</p><p>Uses <a href=\"/wiki/Blueprint\" title=\"Blueprint\">Blueprints</a>, which can be found at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> to create custom ones.\n</p><p>The blueprint fabricator can be used to save the data of a build in the design region to blueprints, which can then be either learned for copying around your base or for selling to other players. Any build can include at most 500 schematics in it.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"c7eb7c60e7b6c244b0f2913118eb0063\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:140px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Photo_of_the_buttons-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:138px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Photo_of_the_buttons.png\" title=\"Photo of the buttons.png (64 KB)\" style=\"height:138px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/31/Photo_of_the_buttons.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240615183424\" title=\"Photo of the buttons.png (64 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Blueprint Fabricator GUI\" height=\"138\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Photo of the buttons.png\" data-image-key=\"Photo_of_the_buttons.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Blueprint Fabricator GUI\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Photo of the buttons.png (64 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Blueprint Fabricator GUI\" height=\"138\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Photo of the buttons.png\" data-image-key=\"Photo_of_the_buttons.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Blueprint Fabricator GUI\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/31/Photo_of_the_buttons.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240615183424\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Blueprint Fabricator GUI</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:140px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Location_of_schematics-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:38px; width:185px; top:50px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Location_of_schematics.png\" title=\"Location of schematics.png (125 KB)\" style=\"height:38px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1b/Location_of_schematics.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240615190529\" title=\"Location of schematics.png (125 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Where to find made custom blueprints\" height=\"138\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Location of schematics.png\" data-image-key=\"Location_of_schematics.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Where to find made custom blueprints\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Location of schematics.png (125 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Where to find made custom blueprints\" height=\"138\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Location of schematics.png\" data-image-key=\"Location_of_schematics.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Where to find made custom blueprints\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1b/Location_of_schematics.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240615190529\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Where to find made custom blueprints</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>The Blueprint Fabricator can now hold u